# this file by `node --import tsx scripts/weather-news/gen.ts`; docs/decisions/weather-news.md). Each row was fetched on
# the date in its last column and answered over https, without a redirect, with an RSS or Atom feed of recent items.
#
# Columns: id | country (ISO 3166-1) | regions (ISO 3166-2, the level-4 code: a province, state or Land; comma between
# several) | areas (ISO 3166-2 level 6, where the region is too large: a Belgian province) | language | name | feed |
# checked.
#
# A row without regions or areas is the country's own news. Keep one feed per broadcaster for a country (its “all news”
# feed, not every section), only https feeds, and none whose terms rule out a paid product (Yle) or a feed made for
# personal readers only (Google News).
